This repository contains eight C programming exercises developed for the CSC1101 Structured Programming course.

The programs demonstrate important programming concepts including output, user input, arithmetic operations, decision-making, loops, calculations, counters and interactive console menus.

Each program was written, tested and organised according to the programming categories provided in the assignment.

